---
import StandardLayout from "/src/layouts/StandardLayout.astro";
import LilBox from "/src/components/LilBox.astro";
import ProjectEntry from "/src/components/ProjectEntry.astro"
---

<StandardLayout title="•Projects and stuff!" image="/images/gayass-derg/projects.png" credit="Art by me">
    <LilBox legend="Projects" hgrow>
        <ProjectEntry title="EBME" image_src="/images/ebme.png" links={[
          { name: "GitHub", url: "https://github.com/supremekirb/ebme", icon: "https://cdn.simpleicons.org/github/white?viewbox=auto" },
          { name: "Starmen.net", url: "https://forum.starmen.net/forum/Community/PKHack/EBME-The-new-map-editor", icon: "/images/icons/starmen.png" }
        ]}>
            <p>
                The primary map editor for EarthBound, made to replace the previous editor which was
                nearly 20 years old. It's written in Python using Qt via PySide6. It reads and writes
                CoilSnake projects.
            </p>
            Features:
            <ul>
                <li>Complete undo / redo support</li>
                <li>Editing data of objects within the program</li>
                <li>Interactive png2fts integration (convert images to map data)</li>
                <li>Collision painting</li>
                <li>Advanced tools for manipulating palettes</li>
                <li>Mario Paint minigame</li>
            </ul>
        </ProjectEntry>
        
        <ProjectEntry title="TicketMaster" image_src="/images/ticketmaster.png" links={[
          { name: "Patch online", url: "/games/patcher?patch=ticketmaster", icon: "/images/icons/box-arrow-down.png" },
          { name: "Starmen.net", url: "https://forum.starmen.net/forum/Community/PKHack/Jank-Jam-3/2359640", icon: "/images/icons/starmen.png" },
          { name: "Demonstration video", url: "https://youtu.be/APr9bJE4Aec", icon: "https://cdn.simpleicons.org/youtube/white?viewbox=auto" }
        ]}>
            <p>
                A hack of EarthBound made with chalkmuncher for a week-long hacking jam. She did the art, I did the gameplay.
                You play as a duo of cats trying to cheat at a ticket-gathering promotion event by stealing people's tickets.
                It's the first EarthBound hack to have an action command system, like Paper Mario.
            </p>
        </ProjectEntry>
        
        <ProjectEntry title="EarthBound Trial Tower" image_src="/images/ebtrialtower.png" links={[
            { name: "Patch online", url: "/games/patcher?patch=trialtower", icon: "/images/icons/box-arrow-down.png" },
            { name: "Starmen.net", url: "https://forum.starmen.net/forum/Community/PKHack/Jank-Jam-2/2354659", icon: "/images/icons/starmen.png" }
        ]}>
            <p>
                Made for a 2-week hacking jam, EB Trial Tower turns the game into a complete rougelike;
                including 100 floors of battles, over 30 types of upgrades, and the bass from Gimmick!
                for NES.
            </p>
        </ProjectEntry>
        
        <ProjectEntry title="EarthBound Beginnings Remake" image_src="/images/ebbr.png" links={[
          { name: "Official website", url: "https://ebbr.neocities.org", icon: "/images/icons/globe.png" },
          { name: "Starmen.net", url: "https://forum.starmen.net/forum/Community/PKHack/The-EarthBound-Beginnings-Remake-Hack", icon: "/images/icons/starmen.png" },
          { name: "Discord", url: "https://discord.gg/u8JxqS8Vs4", icon: "https://cdn.simpleicons.org/discord/white?viewbox=auto" }
        ]}>
            <p>
                A full remake of the NES game EarthBound Beginnings as a ROM hack of its SNES sequel.
                I worked on this project as a programmer and scripter (as well as small musical and graphical contributions) from early 2023 to its release in June 2026.
                I also wrote a chunk of the bugfix/quality-of-life improvements in its sister hack EarthBound: Giygas Strikes Back.
            </p>
        </ProjectEntry>
        
        <ProjectEntry title="EarthGround" image_src="/images/earthground.png" links={[
          { name: "Patch online", url: "/games/patcher?patch=earthground", icon: "/images/icons/box-arrow-down.png" },
          { name: "Starmen.net", url: "https://forum.starmen.net/forum/Community/PKHack/1st-PK-Hack-Jank-Jam/2345182", icon: "/images/icons/starmen.png" },
          { name: "GitHub", url: "https://github.com/pk-hack/CoilSnake/wiki/CCScript-Library#platformer-script-by-supremekirb-based-off-jtolmars-work", icon: "https://cdn.simpleicons.org/github/white?viewbox=auto" }
        ]}>
            <p>
                This was made for the first PK Hack Jank Jam. It's a rewrite of the collision and player
                movement code in EarthBound to turn the game into a 2D platformer. Southwards is
                downwards, and you can use the Y button to jump. Complete with wall kicks, it's possible
                to beat the entire game in this strange way.
                <br><br>
                Additionally, the code behind it is distributed in a script you can include in
                your own EB hacks!
            </p>
        </ProjectEntry>
        
        <ProjectEntry title="MOTHER 3 prologue SNES demake" image_src="/images/mother3.png" links={[
          { name: "Patch online", url: "/games/patcher?patch=m3prologue", icon: "/images/icons/box-arrow-down.png" },
          { name: "Starmen.net", url: "https://forum.starmen.net/forum/Community/PKHack/The-MOTHER-3-Prologue-Demake", icon: "/images/icons/starmen.png" },
          { name: "Demonstration video", url: "https://youtu.be/bm8Q1VB88io", icon: "https://cdn.simpleicons.org/youtube/white?viewbox=auto" }
        ]}>
            <p>
                A hack of EarthBound which turns it into a highly accurate recreation of MOTHER 3's
                prologue sequence. This was made for the 17th anniversary MOTHER 3 funfest on
                Starmen.net. Currently, it's possible to play up until the area with the Dragos. I plan
                on finishing it someday.
            </p>
        </ProjectEntry>
        
        <ProjectEntry title="Joplin To-do View" image_src="/images/todoview.png" links={[
          { name: "Joplin plugins", url: "https://joplinapp.org/plugins/plugin/com.supremekirb.TodoView", icon: "https://cdn.simpleicons.org/joplin/white?viewbox=auto" },
          { name: "GitHub", url: "https://github.com/supremekirb/joplin-todo-view", icon: "https://cdn.simpleicons.org/github/white?viewbox=auto" },
          { name: "NPM", url: "https://www.npmjs.com/package/joplin-plugin-to-do-view", icon: "https://cdn.simpleicons.org/npm/white?viewbox=auto" }
        ]}>
            <p>
                A plugin for the note-taking app Joplin which displays all your to-do items in a list.
                They're sorted into categories based on when they're due.
            </p>
        </ProjectEntry>
        
        <ProjectEntry title="EarthBound Mini-Golf (working title)" image_src="/images/ebgolf.png">
            <p>
                [AS YET UNRELEASED]
                <br>
                Through the power of actual straight-up dark magic, this hack
                turns EarthBound into a mini-golf game.
            </p>
        </ProjectEntry>
    </LilBox>
</StandardLayout>